{% doc %}
  Single source of truth for the "sale" pricing shown on the storefront.

  Shopify Automatic Discounts don't expose their percentage or target
  products to Liquid, so this list is a manual mirror of whichever
  Automatic Discounts are currently turned on in Shopify Admin > Discounts.
  Update this line whenever a discount starts or ends. No product or
  discount data in Shopify is touched by this file.

  Format: one entry per product, "handle:percent_off", separated by "|".

  @example
  {% render 'sale-config' %}
{% enddoc %}solanas-blouse:10|tenenbaum-polo-dress-blue:10|tenenbaum-polo-dress:10|cyber-turtleneck:20|perfect-school-skirt:15|perfect-skirt:15